<title>TURKEY: Turkey's Ottoman Bank prepares for DM eurobond.</title>
<headline>Turkey's Ottoman Bank prepares for DM eurobond.</headline>
<dateline>ISTANBUL 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turkey's Ottoman Bank mandated JP Morgan Securities Ltd. and UBS Ltd. to jointly manage a mark Eurobond issue, a statement by the bank said on Thursday.</p>
<p>This will be the first Eurobond issue by the bank in its 135 year history, the statement said.</p>
</text>
